{"id":"H3310","lemma":"יַפְלֵט","transliteration":"yaphlet","sayIt":"yaph-LET","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Japhlet","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Asher living before Israel's Monarchy, first mentioned at Jos.16.3;\nson of: Heber (H2268);\nbrother of: Shomer (H7763H), Hotham (H2369) and Shua (H7774);\nfather of: Pasach (H6457), Bimhal (H1118) and Ashvath (H6220)\nAlso named: yaph.le.ti (יַפְלֵטִי \"Japhletite\" H3311)\n§ Japhlet = \"he will deliver\"\na descendant of Asher through Beriah","glosses":["japhlet"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"Japhlet","kjv":"Japhlet"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":33,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Japhlet","kjv":"of Japhlet"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:32","note":"Heber became the father of Japhlet, Shomer, Hotham, and Shua their sister.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H3311","lemma":"יַפְלֵטִי","transliteration":"yaphleti","gloss":"Japhletite"},{"id":"H1118","lemma":"בִּמְהָל","transliteration":"bimhal","gloss":"Bimhal"},{"id":"H2268","lemma":"חֶ֫בֶר","transliteration":"chever","gloss":"Heber"},{"id":"H2369","lemma":"חוֹתָם","transliteration":"chotam","gloss":"Hotham"},{"id":"H7763","lemma":"שֹׁמֵר","transliteration":"shomer","gloss":"Shomer"},{"id":"H7774","lemma":"שׁוּעָא","transliteration":"shua","gloss":"Shua"},{"id":"H6457","lemma":"פָּסַךְ","transliteration":"pasakh","gloss":"Pasach"},{"id":"H6220","lemma":"עַשְׁוָ֑ת","transliteration":"ashvat","gloss":"Ashvath"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}